## 3. Strict Role Governance (`V8`)

| Role | Responsibility & Command | Allowed to Update Baselines? |
|---|---|---|
| **Code Writer (`code_writer`)** | Authors the 4-state golden test and generates initial `.png` baselines via `{{golden_update_command}}`. Opens and self-checks every `.png` image before `READY_FOR_REVIEW`. | **Yes** (only when creating or updating a design-approved screen in the phase diff). |
| **Code Reviewer (`code_reviewer`)** | Opens and inspects every generated `.png` golden image against `design.md` (`## UI/UX mapping`) and extracted Figma per-screen `.png` renders using the 10-dimension checklist ([03]({{ref_03}})). Any `BLOCKER` or `MAJOR` visual defect triggers `CHANGES_REQUESTED`. | **No** (read-only inspection). |
| **Test Runner (`test_runner`)** | Runs standard regression comparison via `{{golden_verify_command}}` (**without** baseline-update flags). Any mismatch exceeding tolerance is `FAIL` (`CHANGES_REQUESTED`). | **Never** — running baseline-update flags during verification is a `BLOCKER` violation. |
